demoViews.pipeline=`<div class="demo-label">ILLUSTRATIVE SALES PIPELINE</div><div class="mini-pipeline"><div><b>Discovery</b><article>Needs and timing<br><small>Owner assigned</small></article></div><div><b>Proposal</b><article>Quote shared<br><small>Follow-up due</small></article></div><div><b>Decision</b><article>Next conversation<br><small>Context attached</small></article></div></div><p class="micro">Configured fields can include value, expected close date and next action. Forecasts depend on current records.</p>`;
